T* (ambitious groundwork through forward-thinking frameworks such as the National Digital Economy) Tj
T* (Policy and Strategy \(NDEPS 2020-2030\) and the National EdTech Strategy \(2026-2030\). These) Tj
T* (frameworks champion digital skills development, broadband expansion, and emerging technology) Tj
T* (adoption.) Tj
