70. 545.3899999999999864 Td
(While Nigeria has made commendable strides with frameworks like the National Digital Economy) Tj
T* (Policy and Strategy, our current education and ICT policies struggle to keep pace with the rapid) Tj
T* (advancements in AI and digital learning. The primary gap is not necessarily a lack of ambition,) Tj
T* (but the massive disconnect between high-level policy and grassroots implementation. Currently,) Tj
T* (public school curricula remain heavily theoretical and outdated, leaving students unprepared for) Tj
T* (an AI-driven global workforce.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.439 0.439 0.51 rg
70. 436.3899999999999864 Td
(Furthermore, policies often overlook the critical need for comprehensive teacher upskilling; we) Tj
T* (cannot expect educators to effectively teach emerging digital competencies they have not) Tj
T* (mastered themselves.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.439 0.439 0.51 rg
70. 376.8899999999999864 Td
(To bridge this gap, policy must transition from paper to practical infrastructure. We must mandate) Tj
T* (the integration of applied digital literacy - including basic AI principles, prompt engineering, and) Tj
T* (cybersecurity awareness - directly into the foundational curriculum of primary and secondary) Tj
T* (schools.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.439 0.439 0.51 rg
70. 300.8899999999999864 Td
(A practical recommendation is for the government to partner with local tech organizations to) Tj
T* (establish decentralized, solar-powered digital learning hubs equipped with offline-first educational) Tj
T* (platforms in underserved communities. Through our grassroots training initiatives at NextWave) Tj
T* (Infotech, we have seen firsthand that when students and teachers are given access to localized,) Tj
T* (practical tech education, their adaptation is remarkably swift.) Tj
